            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "293. A grievance appealed to this third step must be served within the time limits previously described by the Representative of the Union to the Employee Relations Manager or his/her designee. Such notice shall state the subject matter of the grievance, identifying grievance control number and objections taken by either party to the previous disposition. Review of the appealed grievance shall take place promptly, not to exceed ten (10) working days following receipt of notice of appeal.",
