        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "296. The arbitrator shall have jurisdiction and authority only to interpret, apply or determine compliance with specific terms of this Agreement and shall not have jurisdiction to add to, detract from or alter in any way the provisions of this Agreement. Any decision within the jurisdiction of the arbitrator shall be final and binding upon all concerned. The expenses and salary incident to the services of the arbitrator shall be shared equally by the Employer and the Union.",
